      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "",
      "talk": "？？？的「世界」。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……這裡是……？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "我記得剛才……大家明明都還在一起。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "奏？真冬？繪名？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "有人在嗎——？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "",
      "talk": "沒有任何回應。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……好安靜。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "這裡……好像「世界」？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "可是，又有哪裡不太一樣……"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "這些東西是……"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "彩帶、包裝紙……還有蛋糕盒？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "這些……不就是我們剛才準備的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "難道這裡真的跟剛才的「世界」有關……？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "……你終於來了。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……！"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "不要害怕。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "初音！？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "嗯。是我。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "你怎麼會在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "因為這裡……就是我誕生的地方之一。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "誕生的地方……？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "這裡是「驚喜的世界」。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "驚喜的……世界？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "是由你們想要為瑞希準備驚喜的心願，慢慢形成的世界。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "所以……這裡才會跟原本的「世界」這麼像。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "可是……這個世界還沒有完成。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "不完整的心願，讓這個世界失去了原本應該有的形狀。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……失控了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "就連我……也被這份失控的力量影響了。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "你……？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "我和這裡的其他存在，都被分裂成了許多沒有意識的實體。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "它們只知道一件事——"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "把你們帶走。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……！"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "所以奏她們……真的被帶走了？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "那我要去哪裡找她們？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "只有你能救她們。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "為什麼是我？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "因為這個世界，是為了你的驚喜而誕生的。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "而你……是這份心願最重要的那個人。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "那我要怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "使用心願的力量。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "這個世界的心願還沒有消失。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "只要你找到那些失控的存在，讓它們重新找回原本的心願……"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "就能讓它們恢復原本的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "可是……我該怎麼找到那份心願？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "當你接近它們時，你就會知道。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "你的心，會告訴你答案。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……聽起來還真像「世界」會發生的事情呢。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "既然是大家為了我準備的驚喜，我可不能就這樣放著不管。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "我要把奏、真冬和繪名全部找回來。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "如果你能修復更多的心願，你的力量也會變得更強。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "那些被修復的存在，也會把自己的心願交給你。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "也就是說……越多人恢復，我就能使用越多力量？"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "可以這麼理解。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "那就更不能浪費時間了。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "走吧，初音。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "一起把這個「驚喜的世界」修好。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "",
      "talk": "就在兩人準備出發時——"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "……等一下。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "name": "瑞希",
      "talk": "我好像聽到了什麼聲音。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "……來了。"
    },
    {
      "background": "BG02",
      "ch01": {"id": "000", "focus": true},
      "ch02": {"id": "mzk_n", "focus": true},
      "ch03": {"id": "v01_n", "focus": true},
      "name": "初音",
      "talk": "失控的存在……找過來了。"
    },
    {
